      "data": {
        "text": "**Planning the Secrets Retrieval**\n\nI've reviewed the Azure Key Vault script and now I'm proceeding to outline the next steps for fetching secrets. I will create scripts for AWS Secrets Manager and Google Cloud in sequence. The goal is to establish a consistent way to handle secret retrieval across different cloud providers.\n\n\n**Creating the File Structure**\n\nI'm now diving into the file creation. I'm focusing on consistency, so `fetch_db_secret.py` will use AWS Secrets Manager and `parse_json_secret.py` will use Google Secret Manager. I plan to use Azure Key Vault for the `rotate_secret_version.py` file too. I'm aiming to keep things organized, so I will get started on the first file, and then move on.\n\n\n",
