        "text": "**Initiating Google Secret Manager**\n\nI'm now integrating `parse_json_secret.py` to leverage Google Secret Manager. I'm focusing on seamless access and secure retrieval of secrets, thinking through the best implementation for this particular use case.\n\n\n",
